  "description": "A comprehensive ASP.NET Core library that enhances functional programming\n      capabilities in web applications. Features include API versioning, global exception handling\n      with enhanced problem details, enum binding and wire formats, model validation,\n      optimized JSON handling, and seamless integration with CSharpEssentials core functional\n      patterns (Result, Maybe, Rule Engine). Perfect for building robust, maintainable, and\n      type-safe web APIs following functional programming principles. OpenAPI documents come from\n      CSharpEssentials.AspNetCore.OpenApi or CSharpEssentials.AspNetCore.Swashbuckle.",
